<section class="tab power-automation-tab {{tab.cssClass}}" data-tab="automation" data-group="sheet">
	<label>Enable Target Automation
		<input type="checkbox" name="flags.dnd4e-health-display.targetAutomation.enabled" {{checked automation.enabled}} {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
	</label>
	<label>Amount of Targets
		<input type="number" name="flags.dnd4e-health-display.targetAutomation.targetCount" value="{{automation.targetCount}}" min="1" step="1" required {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
	</label>
	<label>Area target count
		<select name="flags.dnd4e-health-display.targetAutomation.targetMode" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
			{{selectOptions automationTargetModes selected=automation.targetMode}}
		</select>
	</label>
	<label>Area target filter
		<select name="flags.dnd4e-health-display.targetAutomation.targetDisposition" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
			{{selectOptions automationDispositions selected=automation.targetDisposition}}
		</select>
	</label>
	<label>Include caster in area targets
		<input type="checkbox" name="flags.dnd4e-health-display.targetAutomation.includeCaster" {{checked automation.includeCaster}} {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
	</label>
	<p>Supports weapon, melee, ranged, close burst/blast and area burst/blast powers on square grids. Attack powers open the attack dialog; other powers use Confirm to commit the use and use effects. Area size and placement range use the power's Area and Range fields. Close bursts always exclude the caster.</p>
	<p>Area target count defaults to all creatures matching the filter. Exact count uses Amount of Targets. Allies and enemies use token disposition relative to the caster; neutral tokens only match All creatures. Include caster overrides the disposition filter for the caster.</p>
	<p>Target count, range and area membership are advisory. Area cover, line of effect, elevation and special targeting requirements need manual checking.</p>
	<label>On confirm, place Region on selected area
		<input type="checkbox" name="flags.dnd4e-health-display.targetAutomation.placeRegion" {{checked automation.placeRegion}} {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
	</label>
	<p>Places a persistent Region for close burst/blast and area burst/blast powers when the use is committed. Close bursts leave out the caster's space. Requires permission to create Regions; remove the Region manually when it ends.</p>
	<p>Enabling target automation disables this power's use macros.</p>
</section>
